OL,3,GNEWSAAngler's 52kg carp catch hailed as
OL,4,Aworld record
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn angler from Lancashire has landed a
OL,7,Fcarp being hailed as a new world record
OL,8,Fafter travelling to a lake in Hungary.
OL,10,FAsh Hegarty, from Blackburn, caught a
OL,11,F52kg (114lb 10oz) common carp and said
OL,12,Flanding the fish was "indescribable".
OL,14,FPhotographs and videos of the catch
OL,15,Fhave been shared widely online, with
OL,16,FHegarty receiving calls from German and
OL,17,FSwedish journalists.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
