OL,3,GNEWSAAngler's 52kg carp catch hailed as
OL,4,Aworld record
OL,5,
OL,6,FHegarty said: "I'm just an ordinary lad
OL,7,Ffrom Blackburn who loves fishing, and
OL,8,Fsomehow I've found myself at the centre
OL,9,Fof a story being shared around the
OL,10,Fworld after catching what is being
OL,11,Fdescribed as a new world-record carp."
